#. Setting description (Shaders > Guided Detail Enhance > Regularization (EPS))
msgid ""
"Adjust Regularization for this shader. The default preserves the shader "
"author's setting."
msgstr "调整此着色器的正则化。默认保留着色器作者的设定。"

#. Setting name (Shaders > Guided Detail Enhance)
msgid "Subsampling (SUBSAM)"
msgstr "子采样 (SUBSAM)"

#. Setting description (Shaders > Guided Detail Enhance > Subsampling (SUBSAM))
