"author's setting."
msgstr "调整此着色器的子采样。默认保留着色器作者的设定。"

#. Section description (Shaders > Clarity)
msgid "Adjust local contrast in dark and bright areas."
msgstr "调整暗部和亮部的局部对比度。"

#. Setting name (Shaders > Clarity)
msgid "SHIFT (SHIFT)"
msgstr "位移 (SHIFT)"

#. Setting description (Shaders > Clarity > SHIFT (SHIFT))
