msgstr "调整此着色器的阴影强度。默认保留着色器作者的设定。"

#. Setting name (Shaders > Clarity)
msgid "Highlight Strength (STRL)"
msgstr "高光强度 (STRL)"

#. Setting description (Shaders > Clarity > Highlight Strength (STRL))
msgid ""
"Adjust Highlight Strength for this shader. The default preserves the shader "
"author's setting."
msgstr "调整此着色器的高光强度。默认保留着色器作者的设定。"

#. Setting name (Shaders > Clarity)
msgid "BM (BM)"
msgstr "BM (BM)"

#. Setting description (Shaders > Clarity > BM (BM))
msgid ""
"Adjust BM for this shader. The default preserves the shader author's setting."
msgstr "调整此着色器的 BM。默认保留着色器作者的设定。"

#. Setting name (Shaders > Clarity)
msgid "CD (CD)"
msgstr "CD (CD)"

#. Setting description (Shaders > Clarity > CD (CD))
msgid ""
"Adjust CD for this shader. The default preserves the shader author's setting."
msgstr "调整此着色器的 CD。默认保留着色器作者的设定。"

#. Setting name (Shaders > Clarity)
msgid "CL (CL)"
msgstr "CL (CL)"

#. Setting description (Shaders > Clarity > CL (CL))
msgid ""
"Adjust CL for this shader. The default preserves the shader author's setting."
msgstr "调整此着色器的 CL。默认保留着色器作者的设定。"

#. Section description (Shaders > FSRCNNX 2x)
msgid "Neural 2x upscaling. Activates only when enlargement is sufficient."
msgstr "Neural 2 倍放大。仅在放大比例足够时启用。"

#. Section description (Shaders > AiUpscale Photo 2x)
msgid "Photo-oriented neural 2x upscaling."
msgstr "面向照片的神经 2 倍放大。"

#. Setting name (Shaders > AiUpscale Photo 2x)
msgid "Sharpen (SHARP)"
msgstr "锐化 (SHARP)"

#. Setting description (Shaders > AiUpscale Photo 2x > Sharpen (SHARP))
msgid ""
"Adjust Sharpen for this shader. The default preserves the shader author's "
"setting."
msgstr "调整此着色器的锐化。默认保留着色器作者的设定。"

#. Section description (Shaders > RAVU Zoom AR R2)
msgid "Adaptive upscaling with anti-ringing. Radius 2, the fastest RAVU Zoom."
msgstr "带抗振铃的自适应放大。半径 2，RAVU Zoom 系列中速度最快。"

#. Section description (Shaders > RAVU Zoom R3)
msgid "Adaptive upscaling with radius 3. More detail than R2, slower."
msgstr "半径 3 的自适应放大。比 R2 细节更丰富，但速度更慢。"

#. Section description (Shaders > RAVU Zoom AR R3)
msgid "Radius 3 with anti-ringing. Highest RAVU quality, slowest."
msgstr "半径 3 并带抗振铃。RAVU 系列中画质最高，速度最慢。"

#. Section description (Shaders > Anime4K CNN 2x M)
msgid "For 2D animation. Neural 2x upscaling."
msgstr "用于 2D 动画。Neural 2× 放大。"

#. Section description (Shaders > ArtCNN C4F16)
msgid "For 2D animation. Initial shader compilation can take several seconds."
msgstr "用于 2D 动画。初始着色器编译可能需要几秒钟。"

#. Section description (Shaders > CuNNy 2x12 DS)
msgid "For 2D animation. Neural 2x upscaling with denoising."
msgstr "用于 2D 动画。带降噪的神经 2 倍放大。"

#. Section description (Shaders > SSimDownscaler)
msgid ""
"Refine image downscaling. Requires a smaller output size; works best with "
"Mitchell as downscaler."
msgstr "细化图像缩小。需要较小的输出尺寸；与 Mitchell 缩小器搭配使用效果最佳。"

#. Section description (Shaders > DPID)
msgid "Detail-preserving downscaling. Requires a smaller output size."
msgstr "保细节缩小。需要较小的输出尺寸。"

#. Setting name (Shaders > DPID)
msgid "LBD (LBD)"
msgstr "LBD (LBD)"

#. Setting description (Shaders > DPID > LBD (LBD))
msgid ""
"Adjust LBD for this shader. The default preserves the shader author's "
"setting."
msgstr "调整此着色器的 LBD。默认保留着色器作者的设定。"

